sequenceDiagram
    %% SEQUENCE DIAGRAM: SIGNAL-TO-PAPER-ORDER FLOW (INCLUDING RISK REJECTION)
    autonumber

    actor Operator as Operator / User
    participant Ingestion as Ingestion Engine (Binance/Solana)
    participant Hermes as Hermes Multi-Agent
    participant Skills as .agents/skills/
    participant Gateway as AI Model Gateway
    participant LLM as OpenRouter / 9Route
    participant RiskGate as Deterministic Risk Gate
    participant PaperBroker as Paper Broker Simulator
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16
    participant Telegram as Telegram Bot Service

    %% 1. Ingestion Event
    Note over Ingestion,Hermes: 1. Ingestion Data Pasar & Swap Event
    Ingestion->>DB: Simpan Raw Observation / Market Snapshot
    Ingestion->>Hermes: Memicu Event Analisis Sinyal (Token / Symbol)

    %% 2. Hermes Orchestration & Dynamic Skill Loading
    Note over Hermes,Gateway: 2. Analisis Multi-Agent & Dynamic Skill
    Hermes->>Skills: Baca market-regime-detection / signal-scoring-hybrid SKILL.md
    Skills-->>Hermes: Kembalikan Konteks & Formula Terkompresi
    Hermes->>Gateway: Kirim Prompt Ringkas + JSON Schema
    Gateway->>LLM: HTTP Request (Timeout 15s)
    LLM-->>Gateway: Respons JSON Terstruktur
    Gateway->>Gateway: Validasi Skema Pydantic (Strict Mode)
    Gateway-->>Hermes: Objek Sinyal Valid (BUY/SELL, Entry, SL, TP1, TP2)
    Hermes->>DB: Catat Rekomendasi ke trading_signals (Status: PENDING)

    %% 3. Evaluasi Risk Gate
    Note over Hermes,RiskGate: 3. Evaluasi 9 Pintu Risk Gate Deterministik
    Hermes->>RiskGate: Ajukan Sinyal untuk Validasi
    RiskGate->>DB: Ambil Ekuitas Portofolio, Daily Loss, & High-Water Mark
    RiskGate->>RiskGate: Evaluasi: Expectancy > 0, Risk 0.5%, Daily Loss 2%, DD 8%, Spread

    %% Alternatif 1: Kasus Penolakan Risiko (REJECTED)
    alt Kasus A: Sinyal Melanggar Batas Risiko (REJECTED)
        RiskGate->>DB: Simpan risk_checks (Status: REJECTED, Reason: DAILY_LOSS_EXCEEDED)
        RiskGate->>DB: Update trading_signals (Status: REJECTED)
        RiskGate->>Telegram: Kirim Notifikasi Penolakan Risiko ke Operator
        Telegram-->>Operator: Pesan: "⚠️ Sinyal Ditolak Risk Gate: Batas Kerugian Harian 2% Terlewati"
    
    %% Alternatif 2: Kasus Sinyal Lolos Risiko (PASSED)
    else Kasus B: Sinyal Memenuhi Seluruh Aturan Risiko (PASSED)
        RiskGate->>DB: Simpan risk_checks (Status: PASSED)
        RiskGate->>PaperBroker: Teruskan Sinyal Lolos untuk Eksekusi Simulasi

        %% 4. Eksekusi Paper Broker
        Note over PaperBroker,DB: 4. Eksekusi Order Virtual & Sizing
        PaperBroker->>PaperBroker: Hitung Lot Size Berbasis Risiko 0.5% Ekuitas
        PaperBroker->>DB: Buat paper_orders (Status: SUBMITTED)
        PaperBroker->>PaperBroker: Simulasikan Matching, Slippage Realistis, & Fee
        PaperBroker->>DB: Simpan paper_trades (Status: FILLED)
        PaperBroker->>DB: Buat Posisi Terbuka di positions (SL, TP1 50%, TP2)
        PaperBroker->>DB: Perbarui Saldo Kas & Equity Ledger (Compounding)

        %% 5. Notifikasi Sukses
        PaperBroker->>Telegram: Kirim Notifikasi Eksekusi Paper Trade
        Telegram-->>Operator: Pesan: "✅ Paper Order Eksekusi: BUY SOLUSDT @ 152.40 (SL: 149.35, TP1: 156.98)"
    end
